    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Vincent Walsh Auctioneers is happy to bring to the market:\r\nThis charming detached three-bedroom bungalow which occupies an elevated site of approximately 0.731 acres, enjoying attractive water views and a peaceful rural setting. \r\nOriginally constructed in the 1940s, the property offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout and presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a permanent family home, holiday residence, or countryside retreat. Requiring renovation throughout, this home offers a fantastic opportunity to restore and update to your own taste.\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance porch, hallway, a formal sitting room with an open fireplace, and a family room featuring a solid fuel stove. A kitchen/ dining area. A rear hallway provides access to the attached garage. There are three bedrooms and a family bathroom complete with bath, toilet, wash hand basin, and hot press.\r\nA few items in the property have been upgraded over the years, an Alpha gas boiler, double-glazed windows and doors (a mix of timber, PVC and aluminium), and a natural slate roof with a metal-roofed rear extension. Externally, the home is approached by a gravel driveway providing ample off-street parking and is surrounded by mature grounds extending to approximately 0.731 acres.\r\nLocated in the heart of the Connemara Gaeltacht, Lettermullen offers a unique blend of natural beauty, rich Irish heritage, and a welcoming community. Surrounded by stunning coastline, beaches, and scenic landscapes, it is an ideal location for those seeking a peaceful lifestyle while remaining within easy reach of Galway City. Situated in a tranquil rural location amidst open countryside and individual private residences, the property enjoys excellent accessibility while offering peace and privacy. It is conveniently located approximately 37.3km from Spiddal, 37.8km from Maam Cross, and 55km from Galway City, making it an ideal choice for those wishing to enjoy country living within easy reach of local amenities.\r\n\r\nThis property will appeal to a wide variety of purchasers and Vincent Walsh Auctioneers will strive to be ultra flexible around property viewings.\r\nPLEASE NOTE VIEWINGS ARE STRICTLY PRIVATE BY APPOINTMENT ONLY IN THE COMPANY OF THE AUCTIONEER MR VINCENT WALSH.\r\n\r\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact. Whilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither Vincent Walsh Auctioneer nor the vendor accepts any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars. No person in the employment of Vincent Walsh Auctioneer has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
